    c "虚拟的你无法理解为何突然要独自生活。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1699
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_aa6d11c6:

    # c "She kept asking for Lilly, for example."
    c "比如她一直在找莉莉。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1700
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_7d3af3dc:

    # c "So I decided to add her as well."
    c "所以我决定把莉莉也加进去。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1702
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_36271122:

    # e "[p_name], how could you?!"
    e "[p_name]，你怎么能这样？！"

# game/episode015.rpy:1703
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_398edfc0:

    # c "I know...{w} I know..."
    c "我知道…{w} 我知道…"

# game/episode015.rpy:1704
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_ae18c0a5:

    # c "And then we were imprisoned for six months on the research station."
    c "然后我们就在研究站被囚禁了六个月。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1705
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_0d871744:

    # c "When I was finally able to re-enter the simulation, the situation had gotten worse."
    c "当我终于能重新进入模拟系统时，情况已经变得更糟了。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1706
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_fc346c00:

    # c "Your virtual copy was heartbroken about my absence and Lilly...{w} well, she hated my guts."
    c "你的虚拟拷贝因为我的缺席而心碎，而莉莉…{w} 呃，她恨透了我。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1708
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_bd56cd4e:

    # e "I can imagine."
    e "我能想象。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1710
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_20ce3546:

    # c "So, I did another stupid thing."
    c "所以，我又做了件蠢事。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1711
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_4d0912e3:

    # c "I slightly altered Lilly's personality parameters."
    c "我稍微修改了莉莉的性格参数。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1712
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_3d197c5b:

    # c "My changes somehow amplified Lilly's character traits, creating the jealous version we both encountered."
    c "我的改动不知怎么放大了莉莉的性格特征，造就了我们遇到的这个嫉妒版。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1713
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_018358a8:

    # c "Then everything became glitchy as hell."
    c "然后一切都变得漏洞百出。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1715
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_da498153:

    # e "I'm sorry, [p_name_short], but how could you be so stupid?"
    e "对不起，[p_name_short]，但你怎么能这么蠢？"

# game/episode015.rpy:1716
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_b08999b5:

    # c "I know...{w} I know, there's no excuse."
    c "我知道…{w} 我知道，这无可辩解。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1718
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_75eb130c:

    # "We stared into nothingness for a long while."
    "我们茫然地呆坐了许久。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1719
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_a92433e1:

    # "When Eva spoke again, I was afraid she'd send me away in disappointment."
    "当伊娃再次开口时，我害怕她会失望地把我赶走。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1721
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_54e2789e:

    # e "What was Lilly jealous of exactly?"
    e "莉莉究竟在嫉妒什么？"

# game/episode015.rpy:1723
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_af250eba:

    # e "She seemed to care a great deal for you, more than a sister normally would."
    e "她似乎非常关心你，超出了姐妹间通常的程度。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1725
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_5978f2a9:

    # e "She seemed to care a great deal for you, more than a friend normally would."
    e "她似乎非常关心你，超出了朋友间通常的程度。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1727
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_3388a208:

    # e "Oh..."
    e "哦…"

# game/episode015.rpy:1729
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_5d25027a:

    # e "No..."
    e "不…"

# game/episode015.rpy:1730
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_c8024cdf:

    # e "Lilly wouldn't."
    e "莉莉不会的。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1731
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_b4c20a82:

    # e "She was always so dismissive of you before."
    e "以前她对你的态度总是那么冷淡。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1732
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_bfe25af5:

    # e "But she seems changed here as well."
    e "但在这里她似乎也变了。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1734
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_6c7e56b2:

    # e "Did the virtual version of Lilly fall in love with you?"
    e "虚拟版的莉莉爱上你了吗？"

# game/episode015.rpy:1735
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_7961aac6:

    # c "She did."
    c "是的。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1736
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_3d079133:

    # e "It all makes sense."
    e "这一切都说得通了。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1737
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_d2b8b019:

    # e "Did you do anything to encourage her?"
    e "你有没有做什么事鼓励她？"

# game/episode015.rpy:1739
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_9aa7a3a2:

    # c "I did."
    c "我有。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1741
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_f3b61f1e:

    # e "That still doesn't explain the jealousy towards me."
    e "那还是无法解释她对我的嫉妒。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1743
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_0fe6f4f9:

    # c "I didn't."
    c "我没有。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1744
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_b2bb844d:

    # e "Why the jealousy towards me?"
    e "为什么对我有嫉妒？"

# game/episode015.rpy:1745
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_8890ecb0:

    # c "Because the virtual version of you told me you loved me too."
    c "因为虚拟版本的你告诉我你也爱我。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1747
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_eaf17216:

    # e "Oh...{w} Right..."
    e "哦…{w} 对啊…"

# game/episode015.rpy:1748
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_a32e9c43:

    # c "You don't seem surprised?"
    c "你看起来并不惊讶？"

# game/episode015.rpy:1749
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_59930e1b:

    # e "Yes...{w} I mean...{w} No...{w} I mean..."
    e "是的…{w} 我是说…{w} 不…{w} 我是说…"

# game/episode015.rpy:1751
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_0e0edede:

    # e "You must have changed my virtual personality as well."
    e "你一定也修改了我的虚拟人格。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1752
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_0fe6f4f9_1:

    # c "I didn't."
    c "我没有。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1753
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_8e724611:

    # c "The original version of you had the unaltered personality profile dating from the year before you went to the Academy."
    c "你的原始版本使用的是你进入学院前一年那份未经修改的人格档案。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1755
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_208989e3:

    # e "You said there were glitches, so that's probably the reason."
    e "你说过存在系统故障，所以那很可能是原因。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1756
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_600c1b0b:

    # c "The glitches were caused by Lilly breaking down, which was well after everything else."
    c "那些故障是莉莉崩溃造成的，而这发生在所有其他事件之后。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1758
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_5b15f451:

    # e "Why do I feel I’m suddenly interrogated?!"
    e "为什么我感觉自己突然在被审问？！"

# game/episode015.rpy:1759
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_80573796:

    # e "You were the one who loaded us in your personal playground and tampered with our personality traits."
    e "是你把我们载入你的私人游乐场，还篡改了我们的性格特征。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1760
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_8853cc14:

    # c "And I said I was sorry, I really am."
    c "而且我说过我很抱歉，真心实意地。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1761
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_ed5f7001:

    # c "But Eva...{w} are you, or were you in love with me?"
    c "但是伊娃…{w}你现在，或者曾经爱过我吗？"

# game/episode015.rpy:1763
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_17890477:

    # e "Don't ask me that question, please."
    e "请不要问我这个问题。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1766
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_3ea2b69a:

    # c "Sorry, that was out of line."
    c "抱歉，我越界了。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1767
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_fbfd97f0:

    # e "I think I need some rest."
    e "我想我需要休息一下。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1768
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_9b001cbb:

    # e "Everything feels so confusing."
    e "一切都感觉如此混乱。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1769
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_abbc437a:

    # e "Thank you for coming in to rescue me, though."
    e "不过还是谢谢你来救我。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1770
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_0f7ff419:

    # c "You should rest now."
    c "你现在该休息了。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1772
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_3bc42d98:

    # e "I will, thank you [p_name]."
    e "我会的，谢谢你[p_name]。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1774
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_932968ee:

    # "I left the medbay with a very heavy heart and the feeling that I'd lost something precious just now."
    "我怀着沉重的心情离开医疗舱，感觉刚刚失去了某种珍贵的东西。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1775
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_4f485ea9:

    # "When I softly opened the door to the infirmary again, Eva had already closed her eyes and appeared to be fast asleep."
    "当我再次轻轻推开医务室的门时，伊娃已经闭上眼睛，看起来睡得很熟。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1778
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_852bc115:

    # c "I won't if you really don't want to."
    c "如果你真的不愿意，我不会强求。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1779
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_adfeab83:

    # c "But know that my feelings for you are quite complicated."
    c "但要知道，我对你的感情相当复杂。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1781
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_79161770:

    # c "You're my dearest sister, but for a long time, part of me has been hoping for more than that."
    c "你是我最亲爱的妹妹，但长久以来，我心底一直渴望着超越这层关系。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1783
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_ec5b4363:

    # c "You're my dearest friend, but for a long time, part of me has been hoping for more than that."
    c "你是我最亲密的朋友，但长久以来，我心底一直渴望着超越这层关系。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1784
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_fe179427:

