    c "我爱你，伊娃。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1786
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_4df5bb85:

    # e "Of course you do, we're brother and sister."
    e "你当然爱我，我们是兄妹啊。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1788
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_8f5ed851:

    # e "Of course you do, we've been friends for like forever."
    e "你当然爱我，我们当朋友都这么多年了。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1789
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_230904bb:

    # c "No, I mean I love you."
    c "不，我是说我爱你。"

