    # "Eva’s protest was feebly voiced, but it stopped me nonetheless."
    "伊娃的抗议声微弱无力，却依然让我停了下来。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1829
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_3ea2b69a_1:

    # c "Sorry, that was out of line."
    c "抱歉，刚才我越界了。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1831
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_3956c9c1:

    # e "I...{w} I...{w} Uh...{w} I need some rest."
    e "我…{w} 我…{w} 呃…{w} 我需要休息一下。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1832
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_9b001cbb_1:

    # e "Everything feels so confusing."
    e "一切都感觉如此混乱。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1833
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_abbc437a_1:

    # e "Thank you for coming in to rescue me, though."
    e "不过，还是谢谢你进来救我。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1834
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_0f7ff419_1:

    # c "You should rest now."
    c "你现在应该休息了。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1836
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_3bc42d98_1:

    # e "I will, thank you [p_name]."
    e "我会的，谢谢你[p_name]。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1838
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_932968ee_1:

    # "I left the medbay with a very heavy heart and the feeling that I'd lost something precious just now."
    "我怀着沉重的心情离开了医疗舱，感觉刚才失去了某种珍贵的东西。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1839
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_4f485ea9_1:

    # "When I softly opened the door to the infirmary again, Eva had already closed her eyes and appeared to be fast asleep."
    "当我再次轻轻推开医务室的门时，伊娃已经闭上双眼，似乎睡得很沉。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1842
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_269f3f8b:

    # c "I won’t if you really don’t want me to."
    c "如果你真的不愿意，我不会强求。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1844
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_2fe76d3a:

    # "In the brief pause, Eva didn’t speak, a range of conflicting emotions flashing across her face."
    "在短暂的停顿中，伊娃没有说话，一连串矛盾的情绪在她脸上闪过。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1845
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_037773ca:

    # c "I love you Eva."
    c "我爱你，伊娃。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1847
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_679574aa:

    # c "I love you more than I should love a sister."
    c "我对你的爱已经超出了对妹妹应有的感情。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1849
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_d0bcd96b:

    # c "I love you more than I should love a childhood friend."
    c "我对你的爱已经超出了对青梅竹马应有的感情。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1852
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_9425082e:

    # c "You entered a corrupted simulation."
    c "你进入了一个损坏的模拟程序。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1853
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_72c2a1be:

    # c "I'm sorry you had to go through all that."
    c "很抱歉让你经历了这一切。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1854
translate simplified_chinese ep015_sim_post_836e4a0c:

    # c "I should have deleted it."
    c "我本该删除它的。"

# game/episode015.rpy:1855
